# Target-specific overlay applied on top of sdkconfig.defaults for IDF_TARGET=esp32.
# Classic ESP32 has only 128 KB IRAM; with WiFi+BLE+ADC continuous ISR_IRAM_SAFE
# enabled, the WiFi RX IRAM optimization pushes .iram0.text over the limit.
# Disabling it costs a small amount of WiFi RX jitter (irrelevant here — WiFi is
# pinned to core 0, RT loop runs on core 1) and frees ~16 KB IRAM.
# CONFIG_ESP_WIFI_RX_IRAM_OPT is not set
